# Uncompressed rig originals, kept locally as a working backup.
# unimate/resources/glbs/ ships the meshopt + WebP builds (736 MB -> 59 MB);
# these are the sources they were built from. Deliberately NOT committed: the
# whole repo is the deployed artifact, and 736 MB of duplicates would put the
# published site over GitHub Pages' 1 GB limit. They were once
# recoverable from commit b4ac4c8; that history was purged on 2026-08-06 to get
# the repo back under 1 GB, so the local folder is now the ONLY copy. Back it up
# off this machine before deleting anything in it.
unimate/resources/glbs-raw/

# Uncompressed DIMO rig sources, as unimate/resources/glbs-raw/. They stay in the
# project tree; the homepage thumbnail's lab (resources/overview/dimo/) ships the
# compressed builds (AGENTS.md, "resources/overview/").
dimo/resources/glbs-raw/

# Uncompressed sources of the homepage thumbnail's seven UniMate rigs (the paper
# teaser's own assets); resources/overview/unimate/resources/glbs/ ships the
# meshopt/WebP builds, recipe in unimate/README.md.
resources/overview/unimate/resources/glbs-raw/

# The server bundle's working source. Only the built resources/server.zip is
# published: this folder holds secrets/secrets.enc, and the repo is public.
resources/server/

# Scratch folder render-lab-video.mjs --extra-stages fills for one run and removes after;
# a killed run leaves it behind.
unimate/resources/glbs/_render_tmp/
